<title>POLAND: Universal Q3 net jumps to PLN 12.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Universal Q3 net jumps to PLN 12.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q3 1996     Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				4.26   vs    4.70</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 14.58   vs    4.89</p>
<p>    net				     12.28   vs    4.89</p>
